### ⚡ Appendix — Templates

### 1. Clarifying Questions Template

```
[Task Name] - Clarification

Is my understanding correct that the task requires [restate the task in your own words]?
Are there any other dependencies (APIs, Assets, etc.) I should be aware of before starting?
Is the Scope Mode for this task [UI-only, Backend-only, etc.]?

```

### 2. Foundation Map Template ⚡

```
[Unit/Feature Name] - Foundation Map

Goal: [Briefly describe the unit's goal].
Components:
- [Component 1 Name] - Description
- [Component 2 Name] - Description
Dependencies:
- [Service/API Name] - Type of dependency (e.g., Network, Database)
Potential Changes/Risks:
- [Identify any potential issues or challenges].

```

### 3. Proposal Template

```
[Task Name] - Implementation Proposal

Summary: [A short description of the proposal].
Proposed Steps:
- [First step].
- [Second step].
Expected Impact: [Positive/Negative] on [UI/Performance/Code].

```

### 4. Status Update Template

```
